<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-SPIRLEA OUSTS HABSUDOVA IN OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SPIRLEA OUSTS HABSUDOVA IN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eighth seeded Irina Spirlea of Romania beat Slovakian ninth seed Karina Habsudova in straight sets on Monday to advance to the quarter-finals at the Australian Open.</p>
<p>Ranked 10 in the world, Spirlea recorded her best result in a grand slam, outplaying Habsudova 6-4 6-4 in 69 minutes.</p>
<p>Spirlea will play either fourth seed Martina Hingis of Switzerland or compatriot Ruxandra Dragomir in the quarter-finals.</p>
